sequenceDiagram
    actor Staff as Receptionist
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant API as HMS REST API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (planned)
    actor Doctor as Physician
    Note over UI,DB: Week 8 MVP (Sprint 3) — planned, synthetic data only
    Note over UI,DB: Currently only GET /api/v1/health is implemented
    Staff->>UI: Sign in
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login
    API-->>UI: Session/token and role (planned)
    Staff->>UI: Register synthetic patient
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/patients
    API->>DB: Validate and save patient
    API-->>UI: 201 Created
    Staff->>UI: Select clinician and available 15-minute slot
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/appointments
    API->>DB: Check slot and reserve atomically
    alt slot unavailable
        API-->>UI: 409 Conflict
    else slot available
        API-->>UI: 201 Created
    end
    Doctor->>UI: View daily schedule and start examination
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/appointments?clinicianId=...&date=...
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/encounters
    API-->>UI: 201 Created (IN_EXAMINATION)
    Doctor->>UI: Save examination note and diagnosis
    UI->>API: PUT /api/v1/encounters/{encounterId}/clinical-note
    Doctor->>UI: View/update medical history and allergies
    UI->>API: GET /api/v1/patients/{patientId}/medical-history
    Doctor->>UI: Complete examination
    UI->>API: PATCH /api/v1/encounters/{encounterId}
    API-->>UI: 200 OK (COMPLETED)
    Note over UI,DB: Laboratory request and results belong to Week 10 final, NOT this MVP
